Package: gnome-shell-extension-netspeed-indicator
Version: 1.0.0
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 45)
Maintainer: vzk <vzk@localhost>
Description: Net Speed Indicator - GNOME Shell Extension
 Shows real-time network upload/download speed in the top bar
 beside the WiFi icon. Features include:
  - Real-time upload and download speed display
  - Configurable units (KB/s, MB/s, or adaptive)
  - Data usage tracking with monthly auto-reset
  - Preferences dialog for customization
